//! Sounio semantic authority for Pireus Operator Autogenesis v9.
//!
//! This executable began matcher-free at source commit 42eb5d22e7. Its first
//! admissible transcript was committed at f4735cf82c before the matcher below
//! was written. The matcher freezes that bounded result without promoting a
//! historical, algorithmic, material, priority, or claim-ready statement.

